==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkakə/|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|Ka|cke|lang=de}}; {{hyphenation|Kak|ke|caption=version deprecated in the [[w:German spelling reform of 1996|1996 spelling reform]]|lang=de}}

===Etymology===
Similar to {{etyl|la|-}} ''[[cacare]]'', {{cog|grc|κακκάω|}}, but possibly not directly related to these, instead [[onomatopoeic]], relating to the sound a baby makes when pressing while defecating (“a-a-”).

